  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Oyht_2dNb2E\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在遊戲內開啟整合包：&nbsp;</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">要在 Java 版中使用此模組，您需要對應的 1.20.1 遊戲版本的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.20.1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>GeckoLib</strong></a>。您可以透過切石機使用向日葵取得這些物品，或在創造模式背包中搜尋對應標籤來找到它們。</h3>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblogger.googleusercontent.com%252fimg%252fa%252fAVvXsEh6XTezXZwNjTH7veqScmQkkXIoFqeRV0ehA6uAhQwn-nYiHuLrj06lRtkD-CsYuzbNgDg2mAMEuDieZ38YvI9IQG4SsmP5_u1-uVuG2vwhuKWmOElgEgBRwHTMd3mUXu6vnZsnEqCgSmvflHPxRDfSbXbJ9mbJCjYFs479NWbikdjO28LO6trDWUsIolhp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh6XTezXZwNjTH7veqScmQkkXIoFqeRV0ehA6uAhQwn-nYiHuLrj06lRtkD-CsYuzbNgDg2mAMEuDieZ38YvI9IQG4SsmP5_u1-uVuG2vwhuKWmOElgEgBRwHTMd3mUXu6vnZsnEqCgSmvflHPxRDfSbXbJ9mbJCjYFs479NWbikdjO28LO6trDWUsIolhp=w588-h382\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"382\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblogger.googleusercontent.com%252fimg%252fa%252fAVvXsEhMQCYKvYOyacmu9kDfqtc4vdeWYOUKOyDkJShKp-eKvlieym53bY-hehNrlPr_VtmoKeZyTUAYMqr62a3YMrlEaytpfS6v3xjp5M2l7csGbgzzdV5OQVibe8SBjdZ74IKtuuRHgwfVhyCgx7m5x77ED880QaxVYs3_gjrjE4BUmhOrK9JMJhkrFLcKJJZN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhMQCYKvYOyacmu9kDfqtc4vdeWYOUKOyDkJShKp-eKvlieym53bY-hehNrlPr_VtmoKeZyTUAYMqr62a3YMrlEaytpfS6v3xjp5M2l7csGbgzzdV5OQVibe8SBj